Personal Expense Tracker (SQL + Python + Streamlit)

1. Introduction

Managing personal finances is a daily challenge for many individuals. People often lose track of where their money goes and fail to maintain a budget.
To address this, we built a Personal Expense Tracker using Python, SQL (SQLite), Pandas, Plotly, and Streamlit. The tracker allows users to log daily expenses, categorize them, visualize spending trends, and export data for review. Finally, the app was deployed on Streamlit Cloud, making it accessible from anywhere in the world.

